<a href="Andhra-Pradesh.aspx"><strong>Andhra Pradesh</strong></a>
<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/andhra.jpg" alt="Andhra Pradesh" style="width:200px;height:150px;float:right"  title="Andhra Pradesh"  />
<p>Andhra Pradesh has a rich cultural heritage. The rich history, architecture and culture makes the natives feel proud. The beautiful beaches, hills, wildlife, forests and temples let the state vital for visitors of every age. Here we try to brief some of the places without seeing which the tour of Andhra Pradesh is incomplete.</p>
<br />
