<a href="Karnataka.aspx"><strong>Karnataka</strong></a>
<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/karnataka.jpg" style="width:200px;height:150px;float:right"  alt="Karnataka" title="Karnataka"  />
<p>Karnataka is rich with scenic beauty. This is the eighth largest state in India both in area and population. Bangalore is the capital city of Karnataka and is famous as IT hub housing many small and large IT companies. People who are keenly interested in activities like river rafting, rock climbing, trekking, and paragliding will find tremendous opportunities to indulge their adventurous side when they travel to Karnataka.</p>
</td>
