<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/tamil nadu.jpg" alt="Tamil Nadu" title="Tamil Nadu"  style="width:200px;height:150px;float:right" />
<p>Tamil Nadu is one of the Indian states, located at the southern end of Indian peninsula. Tamil Nadu is a land of Temples with great stone structures. Tamil Nadu is a bastion of Hinduism at its most hearty, whose past endures into the present. </p>
<br />
