<p>Better known as <b>God's Own Country</b>, Kerala is a heavenly portrait splashed with innumerable of enchanting hues. It is a green Venice where nature rules. Kerala, the land of rivers and backwaters is a green strip of land, in the South West corner of Indian peninsula. </p>
